hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1886","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmata hai: Main apne banday ke gumaan ke paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhta hai, aur main us ke saath hun jab wo mujhe yaad karta hai. Muslim mein hai ke agar. To agar wo mujhe apne nafs mein yaad karay to main usay apne nafs mein yaad karta hun, aur agar wo mujhe majlis mein yaad karay to main usay us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. Aur agar wo mujh se balisht qareeb ho to main us se haath qareeb hota hun, aur agar wo mujh se haath qareeb ho to main us se baa qareeb hota hun, aur agar wo mere paas chal kar aaye to main us ke paas daud kar aata hun. (Muslim: 8/62-63). Baab: Zikr par hameshgi aur usay chhorna."
"1887","[AI-translation] Abu Usman Nahdi se, Hanzala Usaidi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke katibon mein se thay. Unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) milay aur kaha: Ae Hanzala! Tum kaisay ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Hanzala munafiq ho gaya. Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah, tum kya kehtay ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hotay hain, Aap hamein aag aur jannat yaad dilatay hain yahan tak ke goya ham aankhon se dekh rahay hain, Muslim mein hai ke aankh. Phir jab ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se nikaltay hain to biwiyon, bachon aur khetiyon mein lag jatay hain aur bohat bhool jatay hain. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak ham bhi isi jaisa patay hain. To main aur Abu Bakr chalay yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hue. Main ne kaha: Hanzala munafiq ho gaya, Ae Allah ke Rasool! To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo kya hai? Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ham Aap ke paas hotay hain, Aap hamein aag aur jannat yaad dilatay hain yahan tak ke goya ham aankhon se dekh rahay hain. Phir jab ham Aap ke paas se nikaltay hain to biwiyon, bachon aur khetiyon mein lag jatay hain aur bohat bhool jatay hain, Muslim mein hai ke ham bhool jatay hain. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, agar tum us par hamesha raho jo tum mere paas hotay ho aur zikr mein, to farishtay tum se tumharay bistaron par aur tumharay raston mein musafaha karein. Lekin Ae Hanzala! Ghari ghari, teen baar. (Muslim: 8/94-95). Baab: Allah Taala ki kitab ki tilawat par ijtema ke baaray mein. (Aafasa se murad mashghool hona hai.)"
"1888","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo momin se duniya ki sakhtiyon mein se aik sakhti door karay to Allah us se qayamat ke din ki sakhtiyon mein se aik sakhti door karay ga. Aur jo tangdast par aasani karay to Allah us par duniya aur aakhirat mein aasani karay ga. Aur jo Musalman ka parda rakhay to Allah us ka duniya aur aakhirat mein parda rakhay ga. Aur Allah banday ki madad mein hai jab tak banda apne bhai ki madad mein hai. Aur jo ilm talash karnay ke liye rasta chalay to Allah us ke liye us se jannat ka rasta aasan karay ga. Aur koi qaum Allah ke gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama nahi hoti jo Allah ki kitab padhti hai aur aapas mein usay dohrati hai magar un par sukoon naazil hota hai, unhein rehmat dhaanp leti hai, unhein farishtay gher letay hain aur Allah unhein apne paas walon mein yaad karta hai. Aur jisay us ka amal peechay karay usay us ka nasab aagay nahi karay ga. (Muslim: 8/71). (Muslim mein in hai.)"
"1889","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya masjid mein halqay par niklay aur kaha: Tumhein kis ne bithaya? Unhon ne kaha: Ham Allah Taala ka zikr karnay baithay hain. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, tumhein us ke siwa kisi ne nahi bithaya? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hamein us ke siwa kisi ne nahi bithaya. Unhon ne kaha: Khabardar! Beshak main ne tum se tohmat ki wajah se qasam nahi li, aur meri manzil wala Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mujh se kam hadees bayan karnay wala koi nahi tha. Aur beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne sahaba ke halqay par niklay aur farmaya: Tumhein kis ne bithaya? Unhon ne kaha: Ham Allah ka zikr karnay aur us par us ki hamd karnay baithay hain jis ne hamein Islam ki hidayat di aur ham par us se ehsaan kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, tumhein us ke siwa kisi ne nahi bithaya? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hamein us ke siwa kisi ne nahi bithaya. Unhon ne kaha: Khabardar! Beshak main ne tum se tohmat ki wajah se qasam nahi li, lekin mere paas Jibreel (alaihissalam) aaye aur mujhe khabar di ke Allah Taala tum se farishton par fakhr karta hai. (Muslim: 8/72). Baab: Allah Taala ke zikr, dua aur istighfar ki majlison ki fazilat."
"1890","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ke sayyar fazil farishtay hain jo zikr ki majlisein talash kartay hain. Yatatabbauna aur yataghauna donon zabt hain. Phir jab wo zikr wali majlis patay hain to un ke saath baithtay hain aur baaz baaz ko apne paron se dhaanp letay hain yahan tak ke apne aur aasmaan-e-duniya ke darmiyan bhar jatay hain. Phir jab wo muntashir hotay hain to upar chadhtay hain aur aasmaan ki taraf jatay hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Allah Taala un se poochta hai jabke Wo unhein un se zyada janta hai: Tum kahan se aaye? To wo kehtay hain: Ham Zameen mein Tere bandon ke paas se aaye jo Teri tasbeeh, Teri takbeer, Tera tahleel, Teri hamd kartay hain aur Tujh se mangtay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo mujh se kya mangtay hain? Unhon ne kaha: Wo Teri jannat mangtay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya unhon ne meri jannat dekhi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Ae mere Rab! Aap ne farmaya: To kaisay hota agar wo meri jannat dekhtay? Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo Teri panah mangtay hain. Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo kis se meri panah mangtay hain? Muslim mein hai ke aur kis se. Unhon ne kaha: Teri aag se, Ae Rab! Aap ne farmaya: Kya unhon ne meri aag dekhi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To kaisay hota agar wo meri aag dekhtay? Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo Tujh se bakhshish mangtay hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Wo farmata hai: Main ne unhein bakhsh diya, unhein jo unhon ne manga diya, Muslim mein hai ke to main ne unhein diya, aur jis se unhon ne panah maangi us se unhein panah di. Unhon ne kaha: To wo kehtay hain, Asal yaquluna tha, Muslim se tasheeh hai: Ae Rab! Un mein falan gunahgar banda hai, wo sirf guzra aur un ke saath baith gaya. Unhon ne kaha: To Wo farmata hai: Usay bhi bakhsh diya, wo qaum hai jis ka humnasheen badbakht nahi hota. (Muslim: 8/68). Baab: Zikr karnay walay mardon aur auraton ke baaray mein."
"1891","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makka ke rastay mein chal rahay thay. To Aap Jumdan naam ke pahar par se guzray. To Aap ne farmaya: Chalo, ye Jumdan hai. Mufrid sabqat le gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Mufrid kaun hain, Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ko kasrat se yaad karnay walay mard aur aurtein. (Muslim: 8/63)"
"1892","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahdah, Us ne apne lashkar ko izzat di, apne banday ki madad ki, girohon par wahdah ghalib aaya, us ke baad kuch nahi. (Muslim: 8/83). Baab: Zikr mein awaz buland karnay ke baaray mein."
"1893","[AI-translation] Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar mein thay. To log takbeer buland awaz se kehnay lagay. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Apne aap par narmi karo. Beshak tum behray ya ghair haazir ko nahi pukartay. Beshak tum sun-nay walay qareeb ko pukartay ho, aur Wo tumharay saath hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main Aap ke peechay tha aur keh raha tha: Allah ke siwa na (gunah se bachnay ki) taqat hai na (neki ki) quwwat. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Kya main tumhein jannat ke khazanon mein se khazana na bataun? To main ne kaha: Kyun nahi, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah ke siwa na (gunah se bachnay ki) taqat hai na (neki ki) quwwat. (Muslim: 8/73). Baab: Shaam ko kya kahay. (Irba'u se murad narmi karna aur awazein past karna hai.)"
"1894","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) shaam kartay to farmatay: Ham ne shaam ki aur Allah ke liye baadshahat ne shaam ki, aur hamd Allah ke liye hai. Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahdah, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se is raat ki khair aur jo is mein hai us ki khair mangta hun, aur Teri panah maangta hun us ke shar aur jo is mein hai us ke shar se. Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun susti, burhapay, buri umr, duniya ke fitnay aur qabr ke azaab se. Hasan bin Ubaidullah ne kaha: Aur mujhe is mein Zubaid ne Ibrahim bin Suwaid se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Abdullah se marfu ke sath izafa diya ke unhon ne farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahdah, Us ka koi shareek nahi, Us ki baadshahat hai, Us ki hamd hai aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke jab subah hoti to Aap ye bhi farmatay: Ham ne subah ki aur Allah ke liye baadshahat ne subah ki. (Muslim: 8/82-83). Baab: Sonay par kya kahay aur pehlu par letna."
"1895","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ne chakki se apne haath mein honay wali takleef ki shikayat ki, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas qaidi aaye. To wo gayeen magar Aap ko na paya, aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se mileen aur unhein bataya. Phir jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye to Aisha ne unhein Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ke aanay ki khabar di. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamaray paas aaye jabke ham apne bistaron mein thay. To ham uthnay lagay. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apni jagah par raho. To Aap hamaray darmiyan baithay yahan tak ke main ne apne seenay par Aap ke qadam ki thandak payi. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein us se behtar na bataun jo tum ne manga? Jab tum apne bistaron mein jao to Allah ki takbeer chautis baar kaho, us ki tasbeeh taintis baar aur us ki hamd taintis baar kaho. To wo tumharay liye khadim se behtar hai. Aur aik riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke Ali ne kaha: Jab se main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, main ne usay nahi chhora. Un se kaha gaya: Siffeen ki raat bhi nahi? Unhon ne kaha: Siffeen ki raat bhi nahi. (Muslim: 8/84)"
"1896","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apna bistar pakro to namaz ke wuzu jaisa wuzu karo, phir apne daayein pehlu par leto, phir kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak main ne apna chehra Teri taraf jhuka diya, apna muamla Tere hawalay kiya, apni peeth Teri taraf lagayi, Teri taraf raghbat aur darr se. Teri taraf ke siwa koi panah aur nijaat nahi. Main Teri kitab par iman laya jo Tune naazil ki aur Tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja. Aur unhein apne aakhri kalaam mein se banao. Phir agar tum apni us raat mein maray to fitrat par maray. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne unhein yaad karnay ke liye dohraen. To main ne kaha: Main Tere Rasool par iman laya jo Tune bheja. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Main Tere Nabi par iman laya jo Tune bheja. (Muslim: 8/77)"
"1897","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apna bistar pakartay to farmatay: Ae Allah! Tere naam se main jeeta hun aur Tere naam se marta hun. Aur jab bedaar hotay to farmatay: Hamd Allah ke liye hai jis ne hamein mar nay ke baad zinda kiya aur usi ki taraf uthna hai. (Muslim: 8/78)"
"1898","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne aik mard ko hukm diya jab wo apna bistar pakray ke wo kahay: Ae Allah! Tune meri jaan paida ki aur Tu usay wafaat de ga. Teri hi us ki maut aur us ki zindagi hai. Agar Tu usay zinda rakhay to us ki hifazat kar, aur agar Tu usay maut de to usay bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se aafiyat mangta hun. To us se aik mard ne kaha: Kya tum ne ye Umar se suna hai? To us ne kaha: Umar se behtar se, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se. (Muslim: 8/78)"
"1899","[AI-translation] Suhail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salih hamein hukm detay thay jab ham mein se koi sonay ka irada karta ke wo apne daayein pehlu par letay phir kahay: Ae Allah! Aasmanon ke Rab, Zameen ke Rab, Arsh-e-Azeem ke Rab, hamaray Rab aur har cheez ke Rab, daanay aur guthli ko phaarnay walay, Tauraat, Injeel aur Furqan naazil karnay walay, main Teri panah maangta hun har cheez ke shar se jis ki peshani Tu pakray hue hai. Ae Allah! Tu awwal hai, Tujh se pehle kuch nahi. Aur Tu aakhir hai, Tujh se baad kuch nahi. Aur Tu zaahir hai, Tujh se upar kuch nahi. Aur Tu baatin hai, Tujh se neechay kuch nahi. Hamara qarz ada kar aur hamein faqr se ghani kar. Aur wo ye Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay thay. (Muslim: 8/78-79). (Awwal se murad makhlooq ke fana ke baad baaqi rehna hai; zaahir se murad har cheez par ghalib hai; baatin se murad makhlooq ki nazron se poshida hai.)"
"1900","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar par aaye to apni tehband ka andruni kinara pakray aur us se apna bistar jhaaday, aur Allah ka naam le. Beshak wo nahi janta ke us ke baad us ke bistar par kya aaya. Phir jab wo letnay ka irada karay to apne daayein pehlu par letay aur kahay: Tu paak hai, Ae Allah, mere Rab! Tere zariye main ne apna pehlu rakha aur Tere zariye uthata hun. Agar Tu meri jaan rok le to usay bakhsh de, aur agar Tu usay bhej de to us ki hifazat kar jis se Tu apne naik bandon ki hifazat karta hai. (Muslim: 8/79). (Dakhila se murad andruni kinara hai.)"
"1901","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab apne bistar par aatay to farmatay: Hamd Allah ke liye hai jis ne hamein khilaya, pilaya, kaafi hua aur jagah di. To kitnay hain jin ka na koi kafil hai na jagah denay wala. Muslim mein hai ke aur na koi jagah denay wala. (Muslim: 8/79). Baab: Namaz-e-fajr ke baad tasbeeh. (Aawa se murad rehnay ki jagah dena hai.)"
"1902","[AI-translation] Juwayriya (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas se subah sawere niklay jab fajr ki namaz padhi thi jabke wo apni namaz ki jagah mein thin. Phir Aap chasht ke baad wapas aaye jabke wo baithi thin, Asal mein hai ke aur wo baithi thin. Aap ne farmaya: Tum usi haal par rahin jis par main tumhein chhor kar gaya tha? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumharay baad chaar kalimay teen baar kahay hain, agar unhein taula jaye jo tum ne aaj se kaha hai to wo un se bhaari hon: SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi, Us ki makhlooq ki tadaad, Us ki zaat ki raza, Us ke arsh ka wazan aur Us ke kalimon ki siyahi ke barabar. Aur un se aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah Us ki makhlooq ki tadaad, SubhanAllah Us ki zaat ki raza, SubhanAllah Us ke arsh ke wazan, SubhanAllah Us ke kalimon ki siyahi ke barabar. (Muslim: 8/83-84). (Aik hadees ke izafay mein hai ke un ke saamnay guthliyan ya kankariyan thin jin se wo tasbeeh kartin thin, us ki sanad sahih nahi, kankari ya guthli se tasbeeh ki har hadees sabit nahi, sunnat daayein haath ki ungliyon se tasbeeh hai.)"
"1903","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah aur shaam SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi sau baar kahay to qayamat ke din koi us se afzal le kar nahi aaye ga siwae us ke jis ne us jaisa kaha ya us se zyada kiya. (Muslim: 8/69). Baab: Tasbeeh ki fazilaton ke baaray mein."
"1904","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do kalimay zuban par halkay, meezan mein bhaari, Rahman ko pyaray hain: SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahil Azeem. (Muslim: 8/70)"
"1905","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mera ye kehna ke SubhanAllah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar mujhe us se zyada pasand hai jis par sooraj tulu hota hai. (Muslim: 8/70). Baab: Tahleel, tahmeed aur takbeer ke baaray mein."
"1906","[AI-translation] Musa Juhani se, Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, apne walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik dehati Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe kalaam sikhaiye jo main kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahdah, Us ka koi shareek nahi. Allah sab se bara hai bohat bara, aur hamd Allah ke liye hai bohat zyada, aur Allah paak hai jo aalameen ka Rab hai. Allah ke siwa na (gunah se bachnay ki) taqat hai na (neki ki) quwwat, Aziz Hakeem ke siwa se. To wo dehati bola ke in kalimon mein to mere Rab ki tareef hai, mere liye bataiye. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rehem kar, mujhe hidayat de aur mujhe rizq de. (Hadees ke rawi) Musa ne kaha ke aafini ka lafz mujhe khayal aata hai lekin yaad nahi ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sabit hai ya nahi. (Muslim). (Asal mein hai ke hamein jagah di, Muslim mein hai ke aur na koi jagah denay wala; guthli ya kankari se tasbeeh ki har hadees sabit nahi, sunnat daayein haath ki ungliyon se tasbeeh hai.)"
"1907","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein Allah Taala ke nazdeek pasandeeda kalaam na bataun? Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe Allah Taala ke nazdeek pasandeeda kalaam bataiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ke nazdeek pasandeeda kalaam SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi hai. (Muslim: 8/86). Baab: Jo din mein sau baar La ilaha illallah wahdahu la sharika lahu kahay."
"1908","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo din mein sau baar kahay: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wahdah, Us ka koi shareek nahi, Us ki baadshahat hai, Us ki hamd hai aur Wo har cheez par qadir hai, to us ke liye das gardanon ke barabar hai. Aur us ke liye sau nekiyan likhi jayein gi, us se sau buraiyan mitayi jayein gi, aur us ke liye us din shaam tak shaitaan se bachao hoga. Aur koi us se afzal le kar nahi aaye ga siwae us ke jis ne us se zyada amal kiya. Aur jo din mein SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi sau baar kahay to us ki khatayein mita di jayein gi chahe samandar ki jhaag jaisi hon. (Muslim: 8/69). Baab: Jo sau tasbeehat kahay."
"1909","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas thay. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke wo har din hazaar neki kamaye? To Aap ke humnasheenon mein se aik sawal karnay walay ne poocha: Ham mein se koi hazaar neki kaisay kamaye? Aap ne farmaya: Wo sau tasbeehat kahay to us ke liye hazaar neki likhi jaye gi ya us se hazaar khatayein mitayi jayein gi. (Muslim: 8/71)"
